---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Art Director Interview Panel";
const breadcrumbs = [
  { text: 'Interview Panels', href: '/docs/levels/interview-panels' },
  { text: 'Graphic Designer', href: '/docs/levels/interview-panels/graphic-designer' }
];
---

<style>
  .role-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .role-table {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 0;
  }

  thead tr {
    background: #f9fafb;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin: 0;
  }

  td {
    padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
  }

  tr:hover td {
    background: #f9fafb;
  }
</style>

<Layout title={title}>
  <main class="py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <article class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto">
      <nav class="flex mb-2" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center">
          {breadcrumbs.map((crumb, index) => (
            <li class="flex items-center">
              {index > 0 && <span class="mx-2 text-gray-400">/</span>}
              <a href={crumb.href} class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900">
                {crumb.text}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </nav>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-[32px] font-semibold text-[#1a1f36] tracking-[-0.4px] mb-6">Art Director</h1>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Interview Stages</h2>
        <div class="role-table mb-6">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Stage</th>
                <th>Interviewer(s)</th>
                <th>Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Recruiter Screen</td><td>[Recruiter Name]</td><td>30 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Hiring Manager Screen</td><td>[Hiring Manager Name]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Portfolio & Vision Presentation</td><td>All Hiring Team</td><td>60 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Round 2: Creative Director</td><td>[Creative Director]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Round 2: Design Leadership</td><td>[Design Leaders]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Round 2: Marketing/Brand Strategy</td><td>[Marketing/Brand Leaders]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Final/Executive Round</td><td>Executive Team Members</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Recruiter Screen</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Leadership Experience, Creative Direction, Team Management</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
            <li>What drew you to art direction, and what excites you about this opportunity?</li>
            <li>Tell me about your experience leading creative teams and directing design projects.</li>
            <li>How do you approach balancing creative excellence with business objectives?</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Hiring Manager Screen</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Strategic Vision, Creative Leadership, Project Management</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
            <li>How do you develop and communicate a creative vision for projects or campaigns?</li>
            <li>Tell me about a significant project where you led the art direction. What was your approach?</li>
            <li>How do you manage multiple creative projects while maintaining quality and meeting deadlines?</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Portfolio & Vision Presentation</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Creative Direction, Strategic Thinking, Leadership Vision</p>
          <p>The candidate should present their portfolio highlighting projects where they provided creative direction, along with their vision for the role. The presentation should demonstrate their ability to develop and execute creative concepts, lead design teams, and align creative work with business objectives. They should showcase their creative process, decision-making, and the measurable impact of their work.</p>
        </section>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-700 mt-8 mb-3">Round 2 Interviews</h3>
        <div class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-gray-200">
          <section class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Creative Director Interview</h3>
            <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Creative Vision, Design Excellence, Strategic Direction</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>How do you develop a creative direction that balances innovation with brand consistency?</li>
              <li>Tell me about a time you had to pivot a creative direction based on feedback or changing requirements.</li>
              <li>How do you ensure design excellence across all deliverables in a project?</li>
              <li>What's your approach to staying current with design trends while creating distinctive work?</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Design Leadership Interview</h3>
            <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Team Development, Creative Guidance, Collaboration</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>How do you approach building and developing a high-performing creative team?</li>
              <li>Tell me about your process for providing creative guidance while empowering designers.</li>
              <li>How do you foster collaboration and creativity within your team?</li>
              <li>What's your approach to handling creative disagreements within a team?</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Marketing/Brand Strategy Interview</h3>
            <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Brand Strategy, Marketing Integration, Business Alignment</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>How do you ensure creative direction aligns with and enhances brand strategy?</li>
              <li>Tell me about your experience translating marketing objectives into creative concepts.</li>
              <li>How do you approach art directing for different channels or audience segments?</li>
              <li>What's your process for measuring the effectiveness of creative work?</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Final/Executive Round</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Strategic Vision, Business Impact, Leadership</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
            <li>What's your vision for how art direction can drive business success?</li>
            <li>How do you approach building relationships with executive stakeholders?</li>
            <li>Tell me about a time your creative leadership had a significant impact on business results.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
